  │ --help          Show this message and exit.                                  │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  ┌─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ audit              Audit a source export and report what would break on      │
  │                    import.                                                   │
  │ preflight          Audit CSV exports against a mapping and the target field  │
  │                    metadata.                                                 │
  │ plan               Write the signed import plan: batches, order, keys and    │
  │                    rollback note.                                            │
  │ reconcile          Compare sources against target dumps; write the reconcile │
  │                    workbook.                                                 │
  │ suggest-mapping    Propose a mapping draft for review (AI-MIG-1, suggestions │
  │                    only).                                                    │
  │ suggest-transform  Propose one value transform, validated on the samples     │
  │                    (AI-MIG-2).                                               │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  
  
  '''
