# name: test_root_help_snapshot
  '''
                                                                                  
   Usage: root [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                                        
                                                                                  
   An implementation engineer's safety kit for Zoho.                              
                                                                                  
  ┌─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ --live                              Read from Zoho via a named profile.      │
  │ --profile                   <str>   Named auth profile (see `zohokit auth    │
  │                                     login`).                                 │
  │ --format                    <str>   Default report format for every command. │
  │ --out                       <path>  Default report file for every command.   │
  │ --strict                            Exit 2 on blocking findings, every       │
  │                                     command.                                 │
  │ --ai                                AI suggestions (says 'AI disabled' when  │
  │                                     unconfigured).                           │
  │ --ai-allow-pii                      Send unredacted values to the AI         │
  │                                     provider (synthetic data only).          │
  │ --ai-max-tokens             <int>   Cap estimated AI prompt tokens.          │
  │ --baseline                  <path>  Accepted-findings file                   │
  │                                     (.zohokit-baseline.json).                │
  │ --max-api-calls             <int>   API call budget per run (default 200).   │
  │ --install-completion                Install completion for the current       │
  │                                     shell.                                   │
  │ --show-completion                   Show completion for the current shell,   │
  │                                     to copy it or customize the              │
  │                                     installation.                            │
  │ --help                              Show this message and exit.              │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  ┌─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ version       Print the package version.                                     │
  │ diff-reports  Show new, resolved and changed findings between two reports.   │
  │ explain       Summarize a report in plain English (template, or AI with      │
  │               --ai).                                                         │
  │ modules       Inspect available modules.                                     │
  │ migration     Audit a CRM migration source before import.                    │
  │ release       Diff sandbox vs production config manifests.                   │
  │ workflow      Trace, lint and scenario-test workflow rules.                  │
  │ forms         Prove a rebuilt form behaves like the original.                │
  │ books         Reconcile Books invoices against CRM deals.                    │
  │ metrics       Check metric contracts over CRM/Books/People data.             │
  │ timeline      Compose a client-safe timeline with contradiction review.      │
  │ lead-routing  Route inbound leads without sending anything.                  │
  │ auth          Connect the toolkit to Zoho (read-only).                       │
  │ doctor        Check a profile before any live read.                          │
  │ cache         Manage the on-disk response cache.                             │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  
  
  '''
